{"title":"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integers</a> which satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/5568ef9be325420645acec5538da913ef6635e3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=(a + bi)^3 - 107i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb8967fa8f1191c7007868db973f7b78ee27012f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^2 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding out both sides of the given <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/922ca1156a03d6e7eb2fced111388cf44ce0029d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c + 107i = (a^3 - 3ab^2) + (3a^2b - b^3)i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"288\" height=\"19\" />.  Two <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_number\" title=\"Complex number\">complex numbers</a> are equal if and only if their <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_part\" title=\"Real part\">real parts</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Imaginary_part\" title=\"Imaginary part\">imaginary parts</a> are equal, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/9/3f9b14b97ad6cb5656d8003820248e5c5b2b72fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a^3 - 3ab^2$\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7e02ee5466b5003485bb943229c9d7b53068bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$107 = 3a^2b - b^3 = (3a^2 - b^2)b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"233\" height=\"19\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a>, this means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Divisor\" title=\"Divisor\">divisor</a> of 107, which is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime_number\" title=\"Prime number\">prime number</a>.  Thus either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e252e8231d31edc45d408eda51d7dc27653d5fea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 107$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e252e8231d31edc45d408eda51d7dc27653d5fea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 107$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d940eb9fab57b0adbf63adcb304cf1961e4ecf34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a^2 - 107^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"115\" height=\"15\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/b/b1b0d6cc0dddc96da90ffe6e5f520903ee9a720e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a^2 = 107^2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"115\" height=\"16\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/0/d302d48f0d8509718f6be973a940d0ed469782fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$107^2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"16\" /> is not divisible by 3, a contradiction.  Thus we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/7/e47294b295cb764c32646e36d772b7325332c5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a^2 = 108$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/5/7850ba4687a8d1edcb56de2937fbdbed8f450a30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 = 36$\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> (since we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is positive).  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cf2e30e2019f2183ceaf0fb9c842456cddc2ca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 6^3 - 3\\cdot 6 = \\boxed{198}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mw2A1Fa7APM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mw2A1Fa7APM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME\" title=\"1985 AIME\">1985 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017145123\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 193/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1431/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4100/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.938      1 Template:AIME_box\n100.00%    7.938      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2800:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017145123 and revision id